  "description": "C# library to support text and person name fuzzy matching. Contains Levenshtein and Damerau-Levenshtein (optimal string alignment) edit distance and normalized similarity functions optimized for speed and reduced memory consumption, including bounded max-distance and min-similarity variants.",
